  "prefLabel": "Lot 7102.22 Winner protection",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7102.22 “Winner protection” means a unique symbol or printed security device, such as a line through the winning combination(s), specific number keyed to a particular winning lucky 7 ticket, or the name of the symbol or some of the symbol colors changed for a winning lucky 7 ticket, or other similar protections placed in the winning window(s) of prize winning lucky 7 tickets.\n\nSource. #13913, eff 3-22-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot7100.html"
